    ('679bb2a2-0107-4af9-a3d8-9d78539dea20'::uuid, 'card_description', 'On a hill outside the village of Ushi, the Iron Age fortress of Ushiberd has almost completely collapsed: stretches of wall line the hill''s edge, and great piles of stone fill its interior.', 'An Iron Age fortress whose walls have almost entirely collapsed. Large stone piles mark where fortifications and interior structures once stood.', 'teaser-card-s023-rollback:679bb2a2-0107-4af9-a3d8-9d78539dea20:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s023: card_description ''An Iron Age fortress whose walls have almost entirely collapsed. Large stone piles mark where fortifications and interior structures once stood.'' restored on Ushiberd', 'df8c6cd9346af43807e853c2ebed23bc867016420426e1a773eec763e73f005a|e6f4d0f40ea721838efe57eeb5ac59b860705b926622aeeeb5614d62a2c95fff|e6f4d0f40ea721838efe57eeb5ac59b860705b926622aeeeb5614d62a2c95fff', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: writer teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-write-013", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "On a hill outside the village of Ushi, the Iron Age fortress of Ushiberd has almost completely collapsed: stretches of wall line the hill''s edge, and great piles of stone fill its interior."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-check-013 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Ushiberd stands on a hill [S1]; the hill is just outside the village of Ushi [S1]; Ushiberd is an Iron Age fortress [S1]; the fortress has almost completely collapsed [S2]; remaining portions of wall run around the edge of the hill [S2]; large piles of stone fill the former interior of the fortress [S3]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-verify-037 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Ushiberd is a fortress [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushiberd]; The fortress dates to the Iron Age [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushiberd]; It stands on a hill outside the village of Ushi [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushiberd]; The site is in Armenia [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushiberd]; The fortress has almost completely collapsed [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushiberd]; Stretches of wall survive and line the edge of the hill [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushiberd]; Great piles of stone fill the interior of the fortress [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushiberd]"}]'::jsonb),
    ('689a3324-ea93-4c8a-b1d4-c0907751c5da'::uuid, 'card_description', 'In the 3rd millennium BC a settlement grew at the end of a once navigable stretch of the Torre River. In the hills around it rose the Megalithic Monuments of Alcalar: around 18 tombs.', 'A Chalcolithic necropolis from the 3rd millennium BC at the end of a once-navigable stretch of the Torre River. Corbelled passage tombs occupy a 10-hectare hillside in the Portimão municipality.', 'teaser-card-s023-rollback:689a3324-ea93-4c8a-b1d4-c0907751c5da:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s023: card_description ''A Chalcolithic necropolis from the 3rd millennium BC at the end of a once-navigable stretch of the Torre River. Corbelled passage tombs occupy a 10-hectare hillside in the Portimão municipality.'' restored on Megalithic Monuments of Alcalar', '618e079c6d3e507807478666b733aa637a3ffe71672bd98107cd0f0257955962|5562d16b5ef89949f60f86f8b200b19ab1287f815ff4933eb1d463da028502c3|5562d16b5ef89949f60f86f8b200b19ab1287f815ff4933eb1d463da028502c3', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: writer teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-rewrite1-001", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "In the 3rd millennium BC a settlement grew at the end of a once navigable stretch of the Torre River. In the hills around it rose the Megalithic Monuments of Alcalar: around 18 tombs."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-check1-001 (check1), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "in the 3rd millennium BC a settlement grew [S2]; the settlement lay at the end of a stretch of the Torre River [S2]; that stretch of the river was once navigable [S2]; the tombs stand in the hills around the settlement [S3]; the monuments are the Megalithic Monuments of Alcalar [S1]; the monuments are around 18 tombs [S3]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05